      "value": "@{5c075935d5cece4df39f010f|full_name}: This is hugely false assumption. There's many, many reasons to have avatars hidden, be it by safety group or individually, the biggest that pops up for me is performance reasons. \nRecently even having been in a world for a group photo with 70+ other people, I absolutely had to have *all* avatars blocked for the time, but I still wanted to talk to my friends while we were setting up.",
