      "value": "@{5c075935d5cece4df39f010f|full_name}: For me there is another reason to block avatars: to keep my fps up. A busy room full of avatars eats my CPU away and i cannot move around much. Block many avatars and i can walk better around.\nThis is very used for others who have not strong CPU but want meet friends in the same room (only friend avatars allowed).\n(Also some avatars have heavy special animations - dont want see them in busy room!)\n\nDon't think they don't want speak with others, it's also matter of keep VRChat playable in the busy room.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
