      "mergeID": "5db7511535da474cbeb5a6f0",
      "mergedPostDetails": "Currently on the Quest all the PC only avatars are substituted with the Error Robot, but they're all the same height. I think it would be nice if even if Quest users can't see the correct Avatar that the substitute Avatar should at least scale to the size of the Avatar it's replacing.",
      "mergedPostTitle": "PCVR only Avatar scale",
      "parentID": null,
      "pinned": false,
      "postDeleted": false,
      "postID": "5b7f61f7c344422f90eb286e",
      "private": false,
      "reactions": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "They could also do some cool stuff with the SDK like have a \"face photo\" for the avatar which gets mapped onto the robot face if you checked that box and took a second photo, just of your face, with another camera during the upload.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
